OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1786447090
OL,3,CCould tougher water restrictions be
OL,4,Ccoming?
OL,6,FThe drought in England and Wales is
OL,7,Fset to last for several weeks, as
OL,8,Fforecasters continue to predict dry
OL,9,Fconditions and high temperatures.
OL,11,FHalf of England and all of Wales have
OL,12,Fbeen plunged into drought, and more
OL,13,Fregions could be declared when
OL,14,Fofficials meet at the National Drought
OL,15,FGroup on Monday.
OL,17,FLast month was the driest July since
OL,18,Frecords began in 1836, prompting
OL,19,Fcompanies to put restrictions on water
OL,20,Fuse for more than 25 million people.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
