OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1786447090
OL,3,CCould tougher water restrictions be
OL,4,Ccoming?
OL,6,FWith dry spells becoming ever more
OL,7,Ffrequent, England and Wales could face
OL,8,Fannual pressures on their water
OL,9,Fsupply, and even more drastic measures
OL,10,Fmay need to be implemented.
OL,12,FBut what does that look like, and what
OL,13,Fcould happen if it continues to stay
OL,14,Fdry? ITV News explains
OL,16,FWhat happens if hosepipe bans are not
OL,17,Fenough?
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
