CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1786447090
OL,3,CCould tougher water restrictions be
OL,4,Ccoming?
OL,6,FThe government has plans in place in
OL,7,Fcase water shortages get so severe
OL,8,Fthat a hosepipe ban will no longer
OL,9,Fhelp.
OL,11,FWhile water companies have the power
OL,12,Fto implement a hosepipe ban
OL,13,Fthemselves, they can take this further
OL,14,Fby applying for a drought permit or
OL,15,Fdrought order from the government.
OL,17,FA drought permit allows a water
OL,18,Fcompany to access water through other
OL,19,Fmeans and reprioritise their supply.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
