OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1786447090
OL,3,CCould tougher water restrictions be
OL,4,Ccoming?
OL,6,FOnce acquired, the authority has wide
OL,7,Fpowers to implement further
OL,8,Frestrictions on water use.
OL,10,FThe first tactic is often to ban "non-
OL,11,Fessential use," which limits the
OL,12,Famount of water businesses can use in
OL,13,Forder to preserve the supply to homes.
OL,14,FThis can see heavy limits applied to
OL,15,Fbusinesses that use a lot of water,
OL,16,Flike car washes or swimming pools.
OL,18,FBetween 1996 and the start of 2026,
OL,19,Fthere have been a total of 124 drought
OL,20,Fpermits and 57 drought orders issued
OL,21,Fin England and Wales.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
