OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1786447090
OL,3,CCould tougher water restrictions be
OL,4,Ccoming?
OL,6,FIf the drought persists, then an
OL,7,Femergency drought order can be issued.
OL,8,FThis grants water companies the power
OL,9,Fto limit the hours taps can be used,
OL,10,Fimpose strict controls on all water
OL,11,Fuse, and completely suspend all non-
OL,12,Fessential water use.
OL,14,FThe last time an emergency drought
OL,15,Forder was issued was during the record
OL,16,Fdrought of 1976.
OL,18,FCould we expect further restrictions
OL,19,Fany time soon?
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
