OL,3,CCould tougher water restrictions be
OL,4,Ccoming?
OL,6,FSeveral water companies have said they
OL,7,Fmay need to make an application for
OL,8,Fdrought orders if the current
OL,9,Fconditions continue.
OL,11,FIn an update on water supply issued in
OL,12,FJuly, Southern Water floated the idea
OL,13,Fthat they may need to apply for a
OL,14,Fdrought permit to meet demand.
OL,16,FThe Environmental Agency has also said
OL,17,Fseveral companies are "considering
OL,18,Fdrought permits, drought orders and
OL,19,Fadditional demand management measures
OL,20,Fto protect supplies".
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
