OL,3,CCould tougher water restrictions be
OL,4,Ccoming?
OL,6,FMany of the statements about the
OL,7,Fpotential need for drought orders were
OL,8,Fmade before the Met Office began
OL,9,Fwarning that another heatwave could
OL,10,Fhit England amber heat-health alerts
OL,11,Fwere issued.
OL,13,FIs this going to be the new normal?
OL,15,F2025 had the driest spring in 100
OL,16,Fyears and the hottest summer ever.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
