OL,3,CCould tougher water restrictions be
OL,4,Ccoming?
OL,6,FThere was a brief respite in the
OL,7,Fwinter, which saw heavy rain replenish
OL,8,Fmany reservoirs, but it looks like by
OL,9,Fthe time summer 2026 is over, analysts
OL,10,Fwill be saying this year was just as
OL,11,Fbad.
OL,13,FWaterwise CEO Nicci Russell wrote on
OL,14,FJuly 22 that this should no longer be
OL,15,Fregarded as a problem confined to
OL,16,Ftraditionally dry regions, describing
OL,17,Fwater scarcity as a "whole of the UK"
OL,18,Fand "now" issue.
OL,26,@yD@UOUyD@eO]zD@EOUzD@IO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/13
