OL,3,CCould tougher water restrictions be
OL,4,Ccoming?
OL,6,FThe Met Office also warned in July
OL,7,Fthat "what we used to think of as
OL,8,Fextreme, we increasingly consider as
OL,9,Fnormal".
OL,11,FWhile warm weather isn't a guarantee
OL,12,Fof drought, demand for water
OL,13,Fskyrockets when temperatures go over
OL,14,F26C, according to the EA.
OL,16,FThe EA's 2026 National Framework said
OL,17,Fclimate change is "affecting us now",
OL,18,Fthat England faces "less water
OL,19,Foverall", and that there is potential
OL,20,Ffor a greater incidence of drought.
OL,26,@yD@SOUyD@dO]zD@TOU{D@HO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/13
