OL,3,CCould tougher water restrictions be
OL,4,Ccoming?
OL,6,FWhat is the government doing about it?
OL,8,FThe EA has said they estimate a
OL,9,Fpotential 5 billion-litre-a-day
OL,10,Fdeficit in public water supplies by
OL,11,F2055 if further action isn't taken.
OL,13,FThe government has accepted that the
OL,14,Fcurrent system is not working and has
OL,15,Fplaced immense pressure on water
OL,16,Fcompanies to clamp down on leaks and
OL,17,Fimprove their infrastructure.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
