OL,3,CCould tougher water restrictions be
OL,4,Ccoming?
OL,6,FWhen Labour came to power, they
OL,7,Fpointed out no new reservoir had been
OL,8,Fbuilt in England in decades and have
OL,9,Fsince announced the funding for nine
OL,10,Fnew ones.
OL,12,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,13,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,14,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,15,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,17,FBut many of these will take years to
OL,18,Fbuild, and some of them have faced
OL,19,Fsignificant opposition from locals.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/13
