OL,3,CCould tougher water restrictions be
OL,4,Ccoming?
OL,6,FIn December 2024, Ofwat announced over
OL,7,F#100 billion in funding from the water
OL,8,Fcompanies for water resources.
OL,10,FMuch of this covered other issues like
OL,11,Fsewage and drinking water, but #8bn
OL,12,Fwas set aside specifically for water-
OL,13,Fresource measures.
OL,15,FSome #12 billion was also set aside
OL,16,Ffor tackling leaks.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
