PN,31713
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1786447090
OL,3,CCould tougher water restrictions be
OL,4,Ccoming?
OL,6,FBut trust in water companies remains
OL,7,Fat historic lows, and with England's
OL,8,Flargest, Thames Water, teetering on
OL,9,Fbankruptcy, it will have to be seen if
OL,10,Fthey can live up to their commitments,
OL,11,Fmany of which will take over a decade
OL,12,Fto carry out.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/13
